<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-RIEDEL WINS WORLD MEN'S DISCUS TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-RIEDEL WINS WORLD MEN'S DISCUS TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Lars Riedel won the world men's discus gold medal on Sunday.</p>
<p>Virgilijus Alekna of Lithuania took the silver and German Juergen Schult the bronze.</p>
</text>
